{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgLP1XER49SWTSyNXKKEs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix is commit `070fa8bc` (PR #743, ticket RESTWS-1037), \"Fix PRIVILEGE_DENIED sentinel leaks into serialized lists, causing HTTP 500.\" The 500 happens because a list whose elements are denied by privilege was serialized with the internal `PRIVILEGE_DENIED` sentinel as an element, and Jackson has no serializer for that `java.lang.Object`. The commit makes any denied element make the whole list return the sentinel, so the caller's check handles it instead of leaking it.\n\nEvidence, best first:\n\n1. **Commit `070fa8bc`** (`openmrs-module-webservices.rest`): the title names RESTWS-1037 and describes the sentinel leak. Its diff is the fix.\n2. **`ConversionUtil.getPropertyWithRepresentation`** (lines 363–373): a denied element in a collection property now returns `PRIVILEGE_DENIED` instead of adding it to the list. This is the path a visit's `encounters` property takes.\n3. **`ConversionUtil.convertToRepresentation` collection branch** (lines 397–406): same propagation for collections converted with a specific converter.\n4. **`ConversionUtil.convertToRepresentation` map branch** (lines 407–419): same propagation for map values.\n5. **`DelegatingResourceDescription` property evaluation** (lines 246–255): collection-valued delegate properties return the sentinel when any element is denied.\n6. **`BasePageableResult.toSimpleObject`** (lines 54–60): this one differs. Denied items are skipped with `continue` rather than failing the whole page.\n7. **PR #743**: the commit message cites it, but I did not fetch the PR page.\n8. **Ticket RESTWS-1037**: the key in the commit title.\n\nTwo notes:\n- The commit adds `ConversionUtilPrivilegeTest.java` (in `omod-common/src/test/...`) with tests for these paths. I left it out of the citations because it does not implement the fix.\n- I did not open `VisitResource` or reproduce the request. The link from the visit endpoint to these lines rests on the commit message and the diff, not on a traced call path.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest\", \"commit\": \"070fa8bca3b59292118da26461b3d2cfd9a06796\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest\", \"pr\": 743},\n  {\"ticket\": \"RESTWS-1037\"},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java\", \"startLine\": 363, \"endLine\": 373},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/ConversionUtil.java\", \"startLine\": 397, \"endLine\": 419},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/resource/impl/DelegatingResourceDescription.java\", \"startLine\": 246, \"endLine\": 255},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod-common/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/resource/impl/BasePageableResult.java\", \"startLine\": 54, \"endLine\": 60}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3583,"cache_read_input_tokens":19931,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3583},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5a944f0-06d9-4868-8ded-c79dce6db45a","uuid":"bfb0d553-005f-448d-b4fd-248f0db89cf2","timestamp":"2026-10-24T03:49:55.512Z","request_id":"req_011CgLP1Wx3KUE4kuwuHTXBW"}
